      "content": "thanks. i checked the docker image locally and the file is definitely there in the /app/dist/ folder. the container runs fine on my machine but fails in the cluster. i'm wondering if it might be a mounting issue or maybe a permission error with the service account. any specific k8s commands or things to check in the manifest to rule those out?",
